              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu yindi ntambara yabereye i Gobu bagwanya Abafilisitiya, Eluhanani mwene Yayare-Oregimu w’i Betelehemu yica mwenewabo wa Goliyati w’i Gati, uruti rw’icumu ryiwe rwangana n’umuhini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.19"
            ]
          }
        }
